<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp Sept-April profit falls 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Perstorp Sept-April profit falls 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish chemicals group Perstorp posted its results for the eight months to April 30, 1997, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				362 vs   456</p>
<p> Sales					 7,778 vs 8,551</p>
<p> Operating costs			   6,971 vs 7,588</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		 3.02 vs  4.08</p>
<p> Operating profit before deprec	  807 vs   963</p>
<p> Depreciation				  369 vs   411</p>
<p> Net financial items	    CHARGE    76 vs    96 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					     128 vs   153</p>
<p> Minorities			 CHARGE    18 vs    11 CHARGE</p>
<p> Net profit				    216 vs   292</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
